{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/915919-simultaneously-active-covers","id":915919,"title":"Simultaneously Active Covers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-16T16:48:29-07:00","id":915919,"title":"Simultaneously Active Covers?","content":"So, I know that the core Demon book explicitly lists the amount of Covers that a Demon can sustain at any given time, based on their Primum. But, I swear I also read somewhere that Demons of a higher Primum can actually exist in multiple places at the same time, allowing two or more of their Covers to be &quot;live&quot; at once. Did I really read this, or am I just going nuts? Is this in one of the corebooks, or am I maybe remembering a fan's rule-mod off of this forum, or am I just confused?<br /> <br /> It's really bothering me, so I thought I'd bite the bullet and ask here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5487-voiddrifter","name":"VoidDrifter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T17:32:48-07:00","id":915937,"title":"","content":"It's not part of the core rules. You might be remembering a particular Embed or Exploit that does something similar; it's certainly within the bounds of what an Exploit might do. The Alibi Embed has similar effects (though it's more like setting a mildly responsive decoy behind), as do Terrible Avatar and Decoy (though only one of the demon's bodies appears to be a human Cover).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T19:17:59-07:00","id":915971,"title":"","content":"If you have a fellow demon that you trust, the expanded pact rules allow you to give or lend them one of your covers.<br /> <br /> Obviously, the potential pitfalls are terrifying to consider.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T01:41:09-07:00","id":916076,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/860642-ms-broken\">Ms. Broken</a> is in two places at one all the time. And she's a starting character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}